[p]Grow, harvest, and command your troop of tiny mushrooms in this auto battler where you have to grow your units. Master the lifecycle of your Sporelings to create specialised units. Adapt to hostile alien worlds by changing your formation, equipment, and traits. All biomass will be assimilated.[/p][h2][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/02-fight-the-heathen"][/img][/h2][p][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/04-battle"][/img][/p][p]Fight the wretched chlorophyll heathen in a Holy War for biomass![/p][p][/p][h2][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/01-grow-your-units"][/img][/h2][p][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/01-plant-and-harvest"][/img][/p][p]Use mutations and fertilisers to create powerful synergies and combos.[/p][p][/p][h2][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/03-pupate-and-train"][/img][/h2][p][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/02-train-and-combine"][/img][/p][list][*][p]5 base weapons[/p][/*][*][p]10 combo weapons[/p][/*][/list][p][/p][h2][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/05-create-powerful-lineages"][/img][/h2][p][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/05-lineage"][/img][/p][list][*][p]Replant fallen units to make their lineage live on![/p][/*][*][p]Mutations, stats, and weapon trainings are preserved across generations[/p][/*][/list][p][/p][h2][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/04-arrange-your-troop"][/img][/h2][p][img src="{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/03-arrange-your-squad"][/img][/p][p]Change your formation to adapt your troop to the coming threat.[/p]
